From my own experience, if you get to a bones level that had
an artifact that you already have, the object is still there
but it is no long an artifact.  If you do not have the artifact
then it will still be there and still be an artifact.

I came across a bones level that originally had had Excaliber, 
Grimtooth, Stormbringer and some others(I think).  When I got 
the bones level it had Excaliber, Grimtooth, what ever else was 
there and a two-handed sword.

